GIMP Palette
Name: Forever Core
Columns: 4
#
# Original Forever palette. These values were chosen for this project and are not
# sampled, traced, or derived from Minecraft's own textures or from any third-party
# pack, including Matcha. Do not replace them with sampled vanilla colours.
#
# The palette is deliberately small. A restrained ramp keeps 16x16 art readable at
# hotbar scale, which the art direction requires, and it stops each new asset from
# inventing its own slightly different browns and greys. Where a state must be
# communicated, use shape, notch, badge, or an icon mark. Colour alone is never
# sufficient, because design principle 16 forbids colour-only state and a resource
# pack may replace every one of these values.
#
# Neutrals: outlines, shadow, and structural edges.
 18  22  26	Ink
 34  55  62	Deep Slate
 82 121 125	Slate
150 168 168	Ash
#
# Warm materials: timber, rope, leather, and worked surfaces.
 92  58  38	Dark Timber
150  96  56	Timber
211 125  63	Amber
243 226 171	Parchment
#
# Cool materials: stone, metal, and cut surfaces.
 58  74  92	Dark Stone
104 124 142	Stone
164 182 196	Pale Stone
226 236 240	Highlight
